{
  "_doc": "The personal layer bootstrap-machine.mjs writes on every PC. Audit and reasons: docs/agent-os/MACHINE-SYNC.md, section Personal layer. {claude} is the config dir, {repo} this machine's primary checkout. A key not allowed by the gate in bootstrap-machine.mjs makes the install refuse: no permission entry installs from here.",
